A junior security engineer in India with certification typically earns an average annual salary between ₹5 LPA and ₹10 LPA in 2026, depending on location, specific skills, and internship experience. Those in Bangalore or Hyderabad with certifications (e.g., CISSP, CEH) and verified experience often secure higher salaries on the upper end of this range

Average Salary: 
    Approximately ₹5–6 Lakhs per year (₹41.8k per month).With Certification/Experience: Junior roles (1–3 years) with certifications and relevant experience can earn ₹8–12 LPA, particularly in cloud security or specialized roles.Salary Range: Honest estimates range from ₹3.5 LPA for entry-level up to ₹10+ LPA for highly skilled juniors.Key Locations: Bengaluru and Hyderabad tend to pay higher, often exceeding ₹6–8 LPA for early-career professionals.

